---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { planets } from "../data/planets";
const featured = planets.slice(0, 4);
const outer = planets.slice(4);
---
<SiteLayout title="Explore our Solar System" description="One star. Eight worlds. Endless wonder. Explore a growing, science-first Solar System encyclopedia with NASA imagery, planetary data and interactive tools.">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="container home-hero-grid">
      <div class="home-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> A field guide to our cosmic neighbourhood</div>
        <h1>One star.<br />Eight worlds.<br /><em>Endless wonder.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">The Solar System is more than a set of planets. It is a story of gravity, fire, ice, oceans, ancient collisions and worlds waiting to be understood.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn" href="/planets/">Begin with the planets <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="/explore/">Explore the system <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="home-proof"><span class="proof-dot"></span> Built around evidence. Designed for curiosity.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="home-art">
        <div class="home-sun-glow"></div>
        <div class="home-sun"><span></span></div>
        <div class="home-orbit orbit-a"><i></i></div>
        <div class="home-orbit orbit-b"><i></i></div>
        <div class="home-orbit orbit-c"><i></i></div>
        <div class="home-orbit orbit-d"><i></i></div>
        <div class="home-orbit orbit-e"><i></i></div>
        <div class="home-art-note">Schematic illustration · Not to scale</div>
        <div class="home-art-label"><span>01</span> THE SUN IS THE ANCHOR</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container home-hero-bottom">
      <span>START ANYWHERE</span><span class="line"></span><a href="/explore/sun/">The Sun</a><span>·</span><a href="/planets/">The planets</a><span>·</span><a href="/explore/moons/">The moons</a><span>·</span><a href="/science/">The science</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-facts container" aria-label="Solar System at a glance">
    <div><strong>~4.6 <small>billion years</small></strong><span>The Solar System's approximate age</span></div>
    <div><strong>8 <small>planets</small></strong><span>Four rocky worlds and four giant planets</span></div>
    <div><strong>99.8% <small>of the mass</small></strong><span>Held by the Sun, approximately</span></div>
    <div><strong>1 AU <small>≈ 150 million km</small></strong><span>Earth's average distance from the Sun</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">01 / The planetary neighbourhood</div><h2>Eight planets.<br /><span class="heading-muted">A thousand different stories.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="section-side"><p>From the scorched inner worlds to the cold giants at the edge of the planetary region, every planet is a distinct natural laboratory.</p><a class="text-link" href="/planets/">View all eight planets ↗</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-planet-grid">
      {featured.map((planet) => <a class="planet-card home-planet-card" href={"/planets/" + planet.slug + "/"}><div class="planet-card-image"><img src={planet.image} alt={planet.imageAlt} loading="lazy" /></div><div class="planet-card-body"><span class="planet-card-kicker">{planet.order.toString().padStart(2, "0")} · {planet.className}</span><h3>{planet.name}</h3><p>{planet.short}</p><span class="text-link">Explore {planet.name} ↗</span></div></a>)}
    </div>
    <div class="home-outer-band">
      <div class="outer-band-copy"><span class="eyebrow">The giant worlds</span><h3>Beyond the asteroid belt, the scale changes.</h3><p>Hydrogen-rich gas giants and water-rich ice giants dominate the outer planetary region.</p><a class="text-link" href="/planets/#outer-planets">Meet the outer planets ↗</a></div>
      <div class="outer-mini-grid">{outer.map((planet) => <a href={"/planets/" + planet.slug + "/"}><img src={planet.image} alt={planet.name} loading="lazy" /><span>{planet.name}</span></a>)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section home-discover">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / Beyond the familiar</div><h2>There is so much<br /><span class="heading-muted">more to discover.</span></h2></div><p>Worlds with hidden oceans. Icy bodies older than the planets. Solar wind reaching into interstellar space. The Solar System is a whole environment, not a diagram.</p></div>
      <div class="discover-grid">
        <a class="discover-card sun-card" href="/explore/sun/"><span class="discover-number">01</span><span class="discover-icon">☼</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Our star</span><h3>The Sun</h3><p>Fusion, magnetic storms, the solar wind and the energy source behind almost every environment here.</p><span class="text-link">Meet our star ↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="discover-card" href="/explore/moons/"><span class="discover-number">02</span><span class="discover-icon">◌</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Worlds in orbit</span><h3>Moons & rings</h3><p>Ocean worlds, volcanic satellites, captured objects and rings built from countless fragments.</p><span class="text-link">Explore the satellites ↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="discover-card" href="/explore/dwarf-planets/"><span class="discover-number">03</span><span class="discover-icon">✧</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Small worlds</span><h3>Dwarf planets</h3><p>Pluto, Ceres, Haumea, Makemake and Eris — and the classification that sets them apart.</p><span class="text-link">Meet the dwarf planets ↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="discover-card" href="/explore/small-bodies/"><span class="discover-number">04</span><span class="discover-icon">☄</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Ancient leftovers</span><h3>Comets & asteroids</h3><p>Primitive building blocks, near-Earth asteroids, meteors and icy visitors from afar.</p><span class="text-link">Explore small bodies ↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="discover-card" href="/explore/"><span class="discover-number">05</span><span class="discover-icon">◎</span><div><span class="eyebrow">The far frontier</span><h3>Outer Solar System</h3><p>The Kuiper Belt, scattered disc, distant objects and the hypothesised Oort Cloud.</p><span class="text-link">Journey outward ↗</span></div></a>
        <a class="discover-card" href="/science/"><span class="discover-number">06</span><span class="discover-icon">⌁</span><div><span class="eyebrow">The hidden rules</span><h3>How it works</h3><p>Gravity, orbital motion, seasons, tides, eclipses, planetary interiors and stellar physics.</p><span class="text-link">Understand the science ↗</span></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">03 / Learn by experimenting</div><h2>Turn facts into intuition.</h2></div><p>Use simple, transparent calculations to explore what changes from one world to another — and what stays the same.</p></div>
    <div class="tool-preview-grid">
      <a class="tool-preview" href="/tools/#weight"><span class="tool-index">TOOL 01</span><span class="tool-symbol">↓</span><h3>Your weight on other worlds</h3><p>Your mass stays the same. Your weight changes with local gravity.</p><span class="text-link">Open calculator ↗</span></a>
      <a class="tool-preview" href="/tools/#distance"><span class="tool-index">TOOL 02</span><span class="tool-symbol">↔</span><h3>Cosmic distance converter</h3><p>Convert astronomical units to kilometres and light-travel time.</p><span class="text-link">Open converter ↗</span></a>
      <a class="tool-preview" href="/tools/#compare"><span class="tool-index">TOOL 03</span><span class="tool-symbol">◉</span><h3>Compare planet sizes</h3><p>Compare planetary diameter and mass with Earth.</p><span class="text-link">Open comparison ↗</span></a>
      <a class="tool-preview" href="/tools/#orbit"><span class="tool-index">TOOL 05</span><span class="tool-symbol">⌁</span><h3>Explore an orbit</h3><p>Move a planet along an ellipse and watch its distance and orbital speed change.</p><span class="text-link">Open orbit lab ↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container home-endcap"><div><span class="eyebrow">Keep looking up</span><h2>Curiosity is a good<br />place to start.</h2><p>Choose a world. Ask a question. Follow the evidence.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/planets/">Enter the encyclopedia ↗</a></section>
  <style>
    .home-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 77% 47%,rgba(33,66,111,.34),transparent 37rem),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(13,23,39,.25),transparent)}
    .home-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.03fr .97fr;gap:25px;align-items:center;min-height:610px;padding-top:35px;padding-bottom:35px}
    .home-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:30px 0}
    .eyebrow-line{display:inline-block;width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--gold);vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px}
    .home-copy h1{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,7.4vw,6.4rem);margin:26px 0 22px}
    .home-copy h1 em{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal}
    .home-copy .lede{max-width:555px}
    .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:29px}
    .home-proof{margin-top:36px;color:var(--quiet);font-size:.73rem;letter-spacing:.05em}
    .proof-dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--cyan);margin-right:8px}
    .home-art{position:relative;height:515px;display:grid;place-items:center;isolation:isolate}
    .home-sun-glow{position:absolute;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(232,174,93,.18),rgba(232,174,93,.06) 45%,transparent 70%);filter:blur(18px)}
    .home-sun{width:112px;height:112px;position:relative;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 32% 26%,#fff4c7,#f6c36f 28%,#db8e43 66%,#8c492b 100%);box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(241,181,89,.48),0 0 100px rgba(229,157,71,.21);z-index:4}
    .home-sun span{position:absolute;inset:-11px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(239,191,119,.24)}
    .home-orbit{position:absolute;border:1px solid rgba(193,210,237,.15);border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-24deg)}
    .home-orbit i{position:absolute;display:block;border-radius:50%;background:var(--dot);box-shadow:0 0 17px var(--dot);width:11px;height:11px;left:12%;top:11%}
    .orbit-a{width:190px;height:116px;--dot:#aeb4bd}.orbit-a i{width:5px;height:5px;left:9%;top:27%}
    .orbit-b{width:270px;height:166px;--dot:#d9a976}.orbit-b i{width:8px;height:8px;left:84%;top:65%}
    .orbit-c{width:360px;height:222px;--dot:#3d8fc5}.orbit-c i{width:10px;height:10px;left:20%;top:91%}
    .orbit-d{width:470px;height:290px;--dot:#c77c5d}.orbit-d i{width:8px;height:8px;left:88%;top:18%}
    .orbit-e{width:570px;height:350px;--dot:#a7b5d6}.orbit-e i{width:14px;height:14px;left:45%;top:-2%}
    .home-art-note{position:absolute;bottom:16px;right:0;color:var(--quiet);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
    .home-art-label{position:absolute;top:28px;right:8px;color:#8e9db3;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.14em}
    .home-art-label span{color:var(--gold);margin-right:8px}
    .home-hero-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:13px 0 18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--quiet);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em}
    .home-hero-bottom a{color:#c0cada;font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:0}
    .home-hero-bottom .line{height:1px;max-width:70px;flex:1;background:var(--line-strong)}
    .home-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0}
    .home-facts>div{padding:0 22px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
    .home-facts>div:first-child{padding-left:0}.home-facts>div:last-child{border:0}
    .home-facts strong{display:block;color:var(--gold-bright);font:600 clamp(1.45rem,2.8vw,2rem) "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.2}
    .home-facts strong small{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0}
    .home-facts span{display:block;margin-top:7px;color:var(--quiet);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.5}
    .heading-muted{color:#8392a8}
    .section-side{max-width:420px}.section-side p{margin:0 0 12px}
    .home-planet-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}
    .home-outer-band{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:24px;margin-top:18px;padding:24px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#14243a,#0b1423);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}
    .outer-band-copy h3{font:600 1.45rem/1.2 "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;margin:12px 0}
    .outer-band-copy p{font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.7}
    .outer-mini-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:9px}
    .outer-mini-grid a{position:relative;min-height:115px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
    .outer-mini-grid img{width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;object-fit:cover;opacity:.73;transition:transform .3s}
    .outer-mini-grid a:hover img{transform:scale(1.05);opacity:1}
    .outer-mini-grid span{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:9px;z-index:1;font-size:.73rem;font-weight:700;text-shadow:0 1px 7px #000}
    .home-discover{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(16,27,45,.65),rgba(8,13,24,.25));border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
    .discover-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:13px}
    .discover-card{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;min-height:245px;padding:20px;background:rgba(13,22,37,.86);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s,transform .2s}
    .discover-card:hover{border-color:rgba(230,200,142,.5);transform:translateY(-3px)}
    .discover-number{position:absolute;top:18px;right:19px;color:var(--quiet);font-size:.67rem;letter-spacing:.12em}
    .discover-icon{font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:20px}
    .discover-card h3{font-size:1.34rem;margin:8px 0}
    .discover-card p{font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:14px}
    .tool-preview-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}
    .tool-preview{padding:23px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#142238,#0b1423);transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s}
    .tool-preview:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:rgba(230,200,142,.48)}
    .tool-index{font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--quiet)}
    .tool-symbol{display:block;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.65rem;margin:17px 0}
    .tool-preview h3{font-size:1.2rem}.tool-preview p{font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.7;min-height:55px}
    .home-endcap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:25px;margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:35px;padding:35px 40px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 35%,rgba(47,80,127,.25),transparent 45%),#0d1727}
    .home-endcap h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);margin:10px 0}
    .home-endcap p{margin:0}
    @media(max-width:900px){.home-hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto;padding-top:35px}.home-copy{padding:20px 0 0}.home-art{height:410px;grid-row:1}.home-planet-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.home-outer-band{grid-template-columns:1fr}.outer-mini-grid a{min-height:130px}}
    @media(max-width:900px){.tool-preview-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
    @media(max-width:600px){.home-hero-grid{padding-top:20px;gap:0}.home-copy h1{font-size:clamp(3.1rem,15vw,4.5rem)}.home-art{height:300px}.home-sun{width:76px;height:76px}.orbit-a{width:130px;height:80px}.orbit-b{width:195px;height:120px}.orbit-c{width:260px;height:160px}.orbit-d{width:325px;height:200px}.orbit-e{width:390px;height:240px}.home-art-label{top:8px}.home-hero-bottom{gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}.home-hero-bottom>span:first-child{display:none}.home-hero-bottom .line{max-width:30px}.home-facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}.home-facts>div{padding:0;border:0}.home-planet-grid{gap:10px}.home-planet-card .planet-card-image{height:140px}.home-outer-band{padding:17px}.outer-mini-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.discover-grid,.tool-preview-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.discover-card{min-height:210px}.home-endcap{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;padding:25px}.home-endcap .btn{width:100%}}
  </style>
</SiteLayout>
